WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.036
Today we will appreciate work using evidence. Our work connects with Ghanaian and

00:00:05.036 --> 00:00:06.152
other African artists.

00:00:07.033 --> 00:00:10.169
Describe visible lines, colours, textures and shapes.

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:15.769
Say which details help communicate the artist’s idea. Record why your chosen

00:00:15.769 --> 00:00:17.348
technique suits the message.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:21.912
Give one evidence-based compliment and one possible improvement.
